    <briefdescription>
<para>LIST(value) - Convert to array/list. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Converts various types to array:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>String: splits by comma or newline</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Object: returns array of values</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Array: returns as-is</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Other: wraps in array </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
